			"notes": "Freeze & Ferment with the latest version of Bagels Baking! This update adds four new biomes, a new villager profession, a home for this villager, both in villages, and standalone.\n\n# Additions\n## Biomes\n- Cherry Orchard\n- Lemon Grove\n- Juniper Taiga\n- Snowy Juniper Taiga\n## Plants\n- Cherry Tree\n- Lemon Tree\n- Juniper Tree\n- Cinnamon Plant\n- Grape Vine\n## Blocks\n- Cheese Block\n- Cheese Layer\n- Cherry Wood type blocks\n- Lemon Wood type blocks\n- Juniper Wood type blocks\n- Trellises (of all wood types)\n### Functional\n- Ice Box - cold inventory that freezes certain items & produces ice slowly\n- Fermenter - processes various items converting them into drinkable alcohols\n## Foods\n- Cherries\n- Lemon\n- Juniper Berries\n- Grapes\n- Grilled Cheese\n- Tomato Soup\n- Snickerdoodle & Sugar Cookies\n- Cherry Jam & Sandwich\n- Glowberry Jam & Sandwich\n- Grape Jam & Sandwich\n- Battered/Fried Porkchop\n- Tonkatsu Sauce\n- Katsu Sandwich (The [JAPPA Meal](https://twitter.com/JasperBoerstra/status/1382648134363459586))\n- Popcorn\n- Cherry & Lemon Meringue Pie\n- Molasses\n- Malt Vinegar\n- Slushees (derived from sodas)\n- Salmon Meal\n- Caramel\n- Caramel Apple\n- Lemon Cake\n- Golden Bagel\n- Steak & Ale Pudding (The [Xilefian Meal](https://twitter.com/Xilefian/status/1421908027205210112))\n### Alcohols\n- Beer\n- Mead\n- Red Wine\n- Whiskey\n- Rum\n- Sake\n- Gin\n- Vodka\n- Ambrosia\n### Milkshake/Ice Cream Types\n- Plain\n- Chocolate\n- Apple Cinnamon\n- Glow Berry Swirl\n- Sweet Berry Swirl\n- Grape Swirl\n## Miscellaneous\n- Vintner Villager Profession\n- Large Wineries found randomly in plains/savanna biomes\n- Small Wineries found in plains/savanna villages\n- Music Disc - Coll by RGBMew\n- BB crops found randomly in Villages/Pillager Outposts \n- BB crops drop from grass\n- Several new advancements, including one that honor MC devs, and creators that helped popularize BB\n# Fixes\n- Candles now can be put in BB cakes\n- Missing pepperoni recipe added\n- Rebalanced all hunger & saturation of foods - buffing many\n- Glow Squid now drops calamari"
		},
